hter Wang Cars. In totaal zijn er vier racelocaties: Los Santos, San Fierro, Las Venturas en Las Venturas Airport (Airraces). NB: met een totale beloning van $ 1.220.000 is dit één van de best betalende missies van het spel, alleen met het exporteren van voertuigen is meer geld te verdienen.\nInhoud\nLowrider Race\nMissie omschrijving\nDeze race hoef je niet meer te doen, omdat je hem al gedaan hebt in de missie High Stakes, Low-Rider van Cesar Vialpando. In de missie kun je een willekeurige Lowrider nemen om de race uit te rijden, als je de race speelt bij de racelocatie in Los Santos krijg je een Blade. De lengte van de race is 1.46 miles oftewel 2,35 km.\nDe race begint bij City Hall en gaat in oostelijke richting naar Verona Beach. Vlak voor de Pay 'n' Spray sla je rechtsaf en kun je vol gas in noordelijke richting naar de wijk Vinewood rijden. Aan het einde van de weg gaat de route linksaf door de kronkelige straten van de wijk Rodeo om daarna in Santa Maria Beach te eindigen. De finish bevindt zich aan het einde van de pier. In de missie kreeg je voor het voltooien van deze race $ 1.000.\nScreenshots\nLittle Loop\nMissie omschrijving\nVoertuig: NRG-500\nLengte race: 0.82 miles oftewel 1,32 km.\nEen korte maar lastige race. Feitelijk moet de race in één keer zonder fouten goed gaan, want tijd om je tegenstanders in te halen is er vaak niet. De race begint aan de kustweg in East Beach Los Santos. Direct na de start gaat de route via de smalle straat omhoog en bovenaan gekomen rechtdoor door de wijk Los Flores heen. Even na The Pig Pen (de stripclub) sla je linksaf en aan het einde weer links om alweer richting de finish te gaan. Je moet aan het einde van de weg nog even links en direct weer rechts om de fabriek heen, de weg oversteken en de bocht om over de finish heen. Probeer geen fouten te maken, denk om al het verkeer en rem goed af in de bochten.\nScreenshots\nBackroad Wanderer\nMissie omschrijving\nVoertuig: FCR-900\nLengte race: 2.05 miles oftewel 3,30 km.\nEen mooie race door de wijken Mulholland en Richman. Direct na de start ga je rechtaf en dan een lang licht bochtig stuk in de richting van Madd Dogg's Mansion. Direct na het passeren van dit gebouw maak je een lastige bocht linksaf (langs je andere safe house daar) en gaat het over bruggen en kronkelige straatjes in de richting van Richman. Aan het einde van de weg is het sterk afremmen, links af e","tokens":["Los"," Santos"," Street","r","aces","\n","|","Ch","allenge"," in"," G","TA"," San"," Andreas","|","\n","|","R","ace"," Tournament","|","\n","|","Ben","od","ig","d","||","Ver","d","ant"," Mead","ows",","," Back"," to"," School","|","\n","|","Loc","atie","||","Little"," Mexico",","," Los"," Santos","|","\n","|","Do","el","||","win"," alle"," races","|","\n","|","Bel","oning","||","$"," 10",".","000"," per"," race",","," $"," 1"," mil","jo","en"," als"," alle"," races"," op"," alle"," loc","at","ies"," zijn"," gew","on","nen",".|","\n","H","et"," Race"," Tournament"," of"," Street","r","aces"," k","omen"," bes","ch","ik","ba","ar"," na"," het"," hal","en"," van"," de"," D","riving"," School"," en"," de"," miss","ie"," Ver","d","ant"," Mead","ows","."," J","eth","ro"," belt"," je"," dan"," op"," met"," de"," med","ed","eling"," dat"," er"," een"," on","offic","i","ë","le"," stra","at","race","-","club"," is"," in"," San"," F","ier","ro"," en"," dat"," ze"," in"," de"," bu","urt"," van"," de"," D","riving"," School"," af","sp","re","ken","."," De"," loc","atie"," in"," San"," F","ier","ro"," is"," ech","ter"," niet"," bij"," de"," ri","js","chool"," maar"," is"," te"," vind","en"," a","chter"," Wang"," Cars","."," In"," to","ta","al"," zijn"," er"," v","ier"," rac","el","oc","at","ies",":"," Los"," Santos",","," San"," F","ier","ro",","," Las"," Vent","uras"," en"," Las"," Vent","uras"," Airport"," (","Air","r","aces",")."," NB",":"," met"," een"," tot","ale"," bel","oning"," van"," $"," 1",".","220",".","000"," is"," dit"," é","én"," van"," de"," best"," bet",